{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["ACC-B1"],"summary":"A provider request seeks ACC-B1 registration, recovery, and login records, but the request remains unanswered in the packet; no response identifies an owner, controller, recovery address, or authenticated session.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-provider-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/provider-request/request-acc-b1"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Bob","ACC-B1"],"summary":"A witness recalls Bob discussing an account problem during a meeting but cannot identify the account number or say that Bob logged into ACC-B1; the statement is contextual and does not establish account control.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-witness-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/witness/paragraph-4"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["ACC-B1"],"summary":"The platform response states that the supplied account export contains no public owner field for ACC-B1, provides no substitute identity, and neither confirms nor denies any person as controller.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-platform-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/platform/field-availability"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Bob Niran","ACC-B1"],"summary":"A memo addendum repeats that the owner is unknown and that Bob Niran is mentioned but not established as controller; it is described as an addendum to the same investigation memo, not an independent confirmation or new ownership finding.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"b-duplicate-001","source_locator":"case-b-scale/memo/addendum-1"}]}]}